      "message": "Thanks for looking! I forgot about Scout! I also could not find an appropriate config in the board/karma directory.\n\nI initially mis-interpreted the on/off numbers as degrees C.  But the tables for fizz and endeavour are used in a fan_percent_to_rpm function, suggesting that those are actually percent.\n\nThis CL is now \"work-in-progress\" as I try different firmware builds and attempt to elicit some fan behavior.",
